  sentences:
  - "Hello, little wanderer\u2026 Can you hear the forest breathing?"
  - "Strange\u2026 you were not here before, yet the forest knows you."
  - "These woods are old\u2026 older than the kingdoms beyond the horizon."
  - Many enter seeking power, but few ever leave.
  - Come closer. I have been waiting for someone like you.
